// =============================================================================
// Host Service - Host Management and Monitoring (Frontend API)
// =============================================================================
// Purpose: Provides host management and monitoring API for the web frontend.
// Allows users to view and manage hypervisor nodes.
//
// Communication: Unary RPC for all operations
//
// Key Features:
// - Host Overview: Summary including CPU, memory, VMs, alerts, recent tasks
// - Monitoring: Time-series metrics (CPU, memory, network, disk)
// - VM Listing: List VMs running on a specific host
// - Permissions: Host access control
// - Datastores: Storage management (mount/unmount)
// - System Settings: NTP, timezone, DNS, routing configuration
// - Maintenance Mode: Enter/exit maintenance mode, VM evacuation
// - Network Interfaces: List and enable/disable NICs
// =============================================================================

